VERSION 13
# Playback script for the package install tests (Development Issues #58):
# opens help topics the way the Help menu and a command's Help button do.
# Run with -T<path to this file>; a missing topic is a regression failure.
# The install test registers a fake browser and checks the URLs it got.
# DEMOINIT as in every demo: without it -T aborts on an unset scale.
DEMOINIT
HELP index
HELP cmdStraight
